# rootless, loopback-only SSH for the disposable CI smoke.
# each invocation supplies temporary host/client key paths and its current user.
Port 2222
ListenAddress 127.0.0.1
StrictModes no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM no
PermitRootLogin no
